        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"faq-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"faq-title\">FAQs</h2>\n  <p class=\"faq-subtitle\">Most common questions answered, no fluff just straight facts.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-list\">\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <button class=\"faq-question\" type=\"button\">\n        <span>What sizes are available?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Lumière Sculpting Leggings come in sizes S, M, L, XL and XXL across seven colours (Black, Grey, Beige, Green, Blue, Purple, Pink). Check the sizing chart on the product page to find your best fit.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <button class=\"faq-question\" type=\"button\">\n        <span>Do you offer returns or refunds?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Yes. Every order is covered by our 30-day money-back guarantee. If you're not fully satisfied, you can return your leggings for a full refund, no questions asked.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <button class=\"faq-question\" type=\"button\">\n        <span>How do I wash and care for them?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Machine wash at a max of 30°C. Do not bleach, do not iron, and do not dry clean. This helps preserve the compression fabric and keeps them shaping effectively wear after wear.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <button class=\"faq-question\" type=\"button\">\n        <span>Are they see-through or too tight?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>No. The fabric is a non see-through, 90% polyamide / 10% elastane blend designed to be breathable and comfortable for all-day wear, while still providing graduated compression to support circulation and shape your silhouette.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <button class=\"faq-question\" type=\"button\">\n        <span>How soon will I see results?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Most customers notice a visible difference within 2 weeks of regular wear, with continued improvement in circulation and skin smoothness over the following weeks.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .faq-section {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 56px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 24px);\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .faq-section * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .faq-title {\n    font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 48px);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n\n  .faq-subtitle {\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 17px);\n    color: #555;\n    margin: 0 0 clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px) 0;\n  }\n\n  .faq-list {\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .faq-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n  }\n\n  .faq-item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n\n  .faq-question {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: none;\n    border: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px;\n    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 22px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 28px);\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #111;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .faq-icon {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 26px);\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1;\n    transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n  }\n\n  .faq-item.active .faq-icon {\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n  }\n\n  .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease;\n    padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 28px);\n  }\n\n  .faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0 0 clamp(16px, 3vw, 22px) 0;\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 16px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n\n  .faq-item.active .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 300px;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var item = btn.closest('.faq-item');\n      item.classList.toggle('active');\n    });\n  });\n</script>",
